2 CONT * Minister of Foreign Affairs (Nov. 30th,1922 - Feb. 9th,1923)
2 CONT * Envoy Extraordinary & Minister Plenipotentiary (Ambassador) to France (1923-1946) -- simultaneously to Belgium, Switzerland, Portugal & Spain (from 1927)
2 CONT * Egyptian Delegate to the League of Nations and Vice-President of the Assembly (1939)
2 CONT * Administrator Suez City and Canal
2 CONT * Vice-President Cairo Electric Railways, Heliopolis Oases Co., etc. 
2 CONT * Raised to personal rank and title of Pasha 11th December 1922
2 CONT * Received: GC of the Orders of the Nile, Legion d'Honneur (France), GCB, etc.
2 CONT * Son of H.E. (Sahib ud-Daula) Hussein Fakhry Pasha, KCMG, sometime Prime Minister of Egypt, by his wife, Nashat Khanum, daughter of  Abdullah Safwat. 
